      "note": "靠近小鳥時"
    },
    {
      "en": "Ants work together as a team.",
      "zh": "螞蟻像團隊一樣合作。",
      "note": "聊昆蟲的特性"
    },
    {
      "en": "I saw a spider in the bathroom!",
      "zh": "我在浴室看到一隻蜘蛛！",
      "note": "告訴家人"
    },
    {
      "en": "Please close the window, or mosquitoes will come in.",
